  "solution": "<div class=\"tex-center\"><figure class=\"tex-figure\"><img src=\"/bank-assets/564f5c2db57c4f7c11a8cef5c6dca0ac8dd2ff8bca87f174140e8bfcbddfafb6.svg\" alt=\"Hình minh họa\" loading=\"lazy\"><span class=\"figure-zoom\" aria-hidden=\"true\">⤢</span></figure></div>\n\t\t<ol class=\"alpha-list\"><li>Vì <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"prefix\">{</mo><mtable><mtr><mtd columnalign=\"right\" style=\"text-align: right\"/><mtd columnalign=\"left\" style=\"text-align: left\"><mi>B</mi><mi>C</mi><mo>∥</mo><mi>A</mi><mi>D</mi></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd columnalign=\"right\" style=\"text-align: right\"/><mtd columnalign=\"left\" style=\"text-align: left\"><mi>B</mi><mi>E</mi><mo>∥</mo><mi>A</mi><mi>F</mi></mtd></mtr></mtable></mrow></semantics></math> nên <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"prefix\">(</mo><mi>B</mi><mi>C</mi><mi>E</mi><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"postfix\">)</mo></mrow><mo>∥</mo><mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"prefix\">(</mo><mi>A</mi><mi>D</mi><mi>F</mi><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"postfix\">)</mo></mrow></mrow></semantics></math>.</li><li>Ta có <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mfrac displaystyle=\"true\"><mrow><mi>A</mi><mi>M</mi></mrow><mrow><mi>A</mi><mi>C</mi></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfrac displaystyle=\"true\"><mrow><mi>B</mi><mi>N</mi></mrow><mrow><mi>B</mi><mi>F</mi></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfrac displaystyle=\"true\"><mrow><mi>A</mi><mi>N</mi><mi>′</mi></mrow><mrow><mi>A</mi><mi>F</mi></mrow></mfrac></mrow></semantics></math>. Suy ra <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>M</mi><mi>N</mi><mi>′</mi><mo>∥</mo><mi>C</mi><mi>F</mi></mrow></semantics></math>.<br>Mặt khác, lại có <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>E</mi><mi>F</mi><mo>∥</mo><mi>N</mi><mi>N</mi><mi>′</mi></mrow></semantics></math> (do cùng song song với <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>A</mi><mi>B</mi></mrow></semantics></math>). <br>Do đó <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"prefix\">(</mo><mi>D</mi><mi>E</mi><mi>F</mi><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"postfix\">)</mo></mrow><mo>∥</mo><mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"prefix\">(</mo><mi>M</mi><mi>N</mi><mi>N</mi><mi>′</mi><mi>M</mi><mi>′</mi><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"postfix\">)</mo></mrow></mrow></semantics></math>.</li></ol>",
